  "ruleText": "Ed 704.01 Minimum Test Scores for High School Equivalency Certificate. The state board shall establish the minimum passing test scores for any high school equivalency test.\n\nSource. #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss by #7780, eff 10-19-02; ss by #9638, eff 1-20-10; ss by #10361-B, eff 6-15-13",
